| Complete cases (denominator) | 24 |
| Incomplete cases (excluded, retained) | 5 |
| pass^k | 0.8333 |
| pass@k | 0.9583 |
| Per-trial success rate | 0.9167 |
| Flake rate | 0.0417 (threshold 0.1) |
| Gate | pass |

